fw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5dae1cb9/uploads/origins/31faa7fa-d957-4dfc-868f-caef9812c7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6e01d835d3c191c2472defda1de88d65", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5dae1cb9/uploads/origins/31faa7fa-d957-4dfc-868f-caef9812c7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6e01d835d3c191c2472defda1de88d65, https://si.imgix.net/5dae1cb9/uploads/origins/31faa7fa-d957-4dfc-868f-caef9812c7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a06ce7da7f0d51dd87456a71af581244 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5dae1cb9/uploads/origins/31faa7fa-d957-4dfc-868f-caef9812c7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6fa1ecd1ace3bd009f585ab0fe213643 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I really love your art! I'd like to request my OCs\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/6656456.mint (adult version)\nnotes: semi-thick eyebrows, the hair on top of his head is shaped like a halo. \nhe is a half angel who brings hope to people in despair. He became depressed after seeing the many dark sides of humanity.\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/2251034.fenn    (adult version)\nCafe owner, outgoing and down to earth. I would like to see him in the left outfit \nnotes: tanned skin\n\nTheir relationship: they are childhood friends who had to part ways. Mint became untrusting of humans and human-like beings , and became depressed. Fenn genuinely wants to help Mint but Mint thinks that Fenn has an ulterior motive. Fenn has always had romantic feelings for Mint, and so does Mint for Fenn. However Mint doesn’t understand his own feelings and always finds himself coming back to Fenn despite being wary of him. \n\nIf there are any unused drafts, I would love to see them as well.\nThank you for considering!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aka_no_ill/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3483161, "client_id": 1729453, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2387018de5dc52c928b8c60fcd8a9e76", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2387018de5dc52c928b8c60fcd8a9e76, https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79224220a6c31aabc1e0272c8e62b6f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59b5e2314fe2eee93ef7ab2418084db9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6eafeebce42d1503e2eb0f02ca6fcc03", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6eafeebce42d1503e2eb0f02ca6fcc03, https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0ecebd666162d8a6a90d231cde6afca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/627bdd7d/uploads/origins/79f08e96-1ad5-40b3-a827-fd488448d876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=db7c6d0194ab436c8ae317e5264653d8 3x"}, "body": "🌊様、はじめまして。\n🌊様のイラストのクールな雰囲気がとても素敵で、ぜひ私からも、と思いご依頼をさせていただきました。\n今回私からは、OCを1名お願いさせて頂きたいです。\n\n【依頼させていただきたいキャラクター】\n◆紅酒 灯縁(くれざか ともり)/情報屋\n人をからかうのが好きで、狙った獲物は逃さない。所謂裏社会の人間で、怪しい取引をしたり、依頼があれば殺しもする。薬品や銃を隠し持ち歩いている。容姿端麗なため、ハニートラップを仕掛けることも多々。人が感情を動かしているのを見るのが好き。\n\n\n【イメソン】　キュートアグレッション / キタニタツヤ\n\n【依頼内容】\n資料内から、🌊様の解釈でお好きなように描いていただきたいなと考えています…！\n世界観や服装、装飾に関しましてもお任せさせていただきたいです…！\n\nまた、こちらは可能であればで構いませんので、PSDデータで人物、背景など分かれているデータがいただけたら嬉しいです…！\n\n\n【使用用途】\n個人観賞、友人との共有、SNSへの掲載、個人の利用範囲での印刷物の作成\n\n要望が多くなってしまい申し訳ございません。\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご縁がありましたらよろしくお願いいたします...！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/99hzw0ncuf7fjs3gqbzi7/ADgkh6iCN6KFvWWEiviKujA?rlkey=njfg0chwm8e4dsfswr0e4t5gr&st=33r6cpb4&dl=0", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aka_no_ill/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3483161, "client_id": 1389755, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc866f56/uploads/origins/dface84e-a71f-48a8-a62d-772f1094391d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac3a1d347fbd6beaad4882489d5b4a87", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cc866f56/uploads/origins/dface84e-a71f-48a8-a62d-772f1094391d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac3a1d347fbd6beaad4882489d5b4a87, https://si.imgix.net/cc866f56/uploads/origins/dface84e-a71f-48a8-a62d-772f1094391d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bda8f843809bc68c376308abf125e9a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cc866f56/uploads/origins/dface84e-a71f-48a8-a62d-772f1094391d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a890d5dfae3556d2641aff9f6c24b8c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc866f56/uploads/origins/dface84e-a71f-48a8-a62d-772f1094391d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed4648f2396d060b2cde5f5c7